OL,3,GNEWSAReform Wales deputy criticises
OL,4,Acolleague for claiming he had most
OL,5,Asupport to be leader
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform's new Welsh deputy leader Laura
OL,8,FAnne Jones says a colleague was
OL,9,Fmisleading when he said he had the most
OL,10,Fsupport to become party leader.
OL,12,FJames Evans claimed last week that he
OL,13,Fwould not take part in the contest to
OL,14,Fbe leader even though most of his
OL,15,Fparty's Senedd members wanted him in
OL,16,Fthe role.
OL,18,FOn Wednesday Jones told BBC Radio Wales
OL,19,FBreakfast she did not recognise that to
OL,20,Fbe the case and did not know why Evans
OL,21,Fsaid it.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
